WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:35.009
[The Heir]

01:35.380 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 37]

01:39.200 --> 01:41.680
Tian family and Li family,
hear the verdict.

01:44.759 --> 01:48.150
The evidence of the Tians'
illicit foreign trade is conclusive.

01:48.150 --> 01:51.680
But regarding who the mastermind is
and what the charges are,

01:51.920 --> 01:53.950
we still need further judgment.

01:54.310 --> 01:56.350
Except for Tian Ronghua alone,

01:56.950 --> 01:58.120
Tian Benchang,

01:58.280 --> 01:59.080
Tian Huai'an,

01:59.400 --> 02:00.350
Tian Bensheng,

02:00.480 --> 02:01.200
Wang Xiu,

02:01.310 --> 02:02.120
Wu Xin,

02:02.400 --> 02:05.430
and 3 accomplices
of the Tian family's illicit foreign trade

02:05.430 --> 02:08.090
shall all be remanded in custody
to await trial!

02:11.560 --> 02:13.590
The Li family's illicit foreign trade is

02:13.590 --> 02:16.360
indeed a false accusation made
by Wu Xin at the Tians' instigation.

02:16.360 --> 02:17.290
It is completely

02:17.470 --> 02:18.680
fabricated.

02:18.870 --> 02:21.310
All members of the Li family

02:21.590 --> 02:22.990
shall be released today.

02:27.470 --> 02:30.630
-Thank you, Your Excellency.
-Thank you, Your Excellency.

02:30.630 --> 02:31.750
Court is adjourned.

02:31.750 --> 02:32.590
Great!

02:33.120 --> 02:33.800
Great!

02:34.400 --> 02:35.079
Great!

02:41.230 --> 02:42.190
Take it slow, Uncle Jingdong.

02:41.329 --> 02:49.100
[Huizhou Prefecture Office]

02:42.280 --> 02:42.800
Okay.

02:44.680 --> 02:45.400
Eighth Uncle.

02:45.400 --> 02:46.030
Zhen.

02:46.030 --> 02:46.750
Zhen.

02:46.960 --> 02:47.890
Uncle Jingdong.

02:48.240 --> 02:49.079
Grandfather.

02:49.190 --> 02:51.240
Zhen, what's the result?

02:51.470 --> 02:52.670
Please rest assured.

02:53.030 --> 02:54.430
The Li family has finally

02:54.710 --> 02:56.640
been cleared of the false charges.

02:57.079 --> 02:58.710
Eldest Aunt, Third Aunt,

02:58.710 --> 02:59.910
and Zhengshen

02:59.960 --> 03:01.220
will also be released.

03:01.430 --> 03:03.470
Don't worry, everything is fine now.

03:03.470 --> 03:05.080
Then let's wait here.

03:05.280 --> 03:06.580
We'll wait for them to come out

03:06.580 --> 03:07.830
and go home together.

03:16.310 --> 03:17.030
Ronghua,

03:17.680 --> 03:19.310
go home with us later.

03:30.280 --> 03:31.030
Zhen,

03:31.710 --> 03:34.040
can you go
to the Chen Ink Workshop with me?

03:44.910 --> 03:45.910
Third Grandfather.

03:45.910 --> 03:47.590
Girl, you really are...

03:47.770 --> 03:48.450
Uncle Junshan.

03:48.450 --> 03:49.079
Zhen.

03:50.240 --> 03:51.190
Ronghua

03:51.470 --> 03:53.030
has something to say to you.

04:00.630 --> 04:01.760
Third Grandfather,

04:02.750 --> 04:03.610
Uncle Junshan,

04:05.630 --> 04:07.470
during the previous Tribute Ink selection,

04:07.470 --> 04:09.590
I was foolish to ask Qing He to step in,

04:09.910 --> 04:12.430
causing the Chen family
to lose the tribute ink contract

04:12.430 --> 04:15.430
and disrupting the rules
of the Huizhou ink industry.

04:16.190 --> 04:19.390
Yet the peers in the Hui Ink industry
still saved me today.

04:19.720 --> 04:21.240
I feel extremely ashamed.

04:22.120 --> 04:23.920
I know my sins are unforgivable.

04:24.510 --> 04:26.950
Whether you want to beat me
or scold me, Third Grandfather,

04:26.950 --> 04:28.410
I will have no complaints.

04:32.360 --> 04:33.490
Third Grandfather,

04:33.830 --> 04:35.630
the Tian family's crimes were made public

04:35.630 --> 04:37.750
all thanks to Ronghua placing
righteousness above family loyalty.

04:37.750 --> 04:40.159
Although the Tian family is notorious
for the crimes they committed,

04:40.159 --> 04:41.360
I can guarantee

04:41.510 --> 04:44.190
that Ronghua is not cut
from the same cloth as them.

04:44.190 --> 04:45.650
The mistake has been made.

04:45.800 --> 04:47.530
Regret won't change anything.

04:47.830 --> 04:50.230
You can't change what's already happened.

04:52.190 --> 04:54.120
You're right, Third Grandfather.

04:55.159 --> 04:57.480
You can't change what's already happened.

04:57.480 --> 04:59.210
I dare not ask for forgiveness.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.480
But I promise,

05:01.310 --> 05:02.750
if Qing He falls one day,

05:03.270 --> 05:06.000
I will turn myself in, testify,

05:06.480 --> 05:08.480
and restore the Chen family's reputation.

05:08.480 --> 05:10.070
Before that day comes,

05:10.830 --> 05:14.160
I promise I will not leave Huizhou,
not even by a single step.

05:21.360 --> 05:24.240
You clarified this matter
in front of everyone

05:24.560 --> 05:27.600
in the ink industry and Prefect He,

05:27.950 --> 05:29.480
without shifting the blame

05:29.510 --> 05:30.920
or making any excuses.

05:31.950 --> 05:35.000
And you even promise
to turn yourself in and testify.

05:36.360 --> 05:37.830
It's truly not easy.

05:39.920 --> 05:40.780
Also, my father

05:42.430 --> 05:44.510
and brothers were engaged
in illicit foreign trade.

05:44.510 --> 05:46.360
They will definitely be convicted.

05:46.360 --> 05:48.800
After that, I will disband
the Tian Ink Workshop,

05:48.800 --> 05:50.060
quit the ink industry,

05:51.120 --> 05:52.520
and never make ink again.

05:52.560 --> 05:54.430
I will also write down every detail

05:54.430 --> 05:57.159
of all the crimes
that the Tian family has committed

05:57.159 --> 05:59.920
and submit it to the Literary Association
for preservation,

05:59.920 --> 06:01.250
so this record of crimes

06:01.800 --> 06:03.400
can warn future generations

06:03.830 --> 06:05.270
as a permanent admonition.

06:05.270 --> 06:07.070
You are having the Tian family

06:07.480 --> 06:10.740
remembered forever as a shame
in the Huizhou ink industry.

06:11.160 --> 06:12.420
It should be like this,

06:12.950 --> 06:14.750
and should have been so long ago.

06:15.390 --> 06:16.850
The title of Tribute Ink is

06:17.120 --> 06:19.250
the lifelong pursuit of any ink maker.

06:21.360 --> 06:24.310
But for family honor
and personal benefits,

06:25.240 --> 06:27.040
I trampled on it.

06:27.720 --> 06:30.480
The Tian family even used the name
of Tribute Ink to cause trouble

06:30.480 --> 06:33.940
and bring about disasters,
doing countless terrible things.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.240
We've hurt you,

06:36.430 --> 06:37.560
Third Grandfather,

06:38.070 --> 06:41.240
Uncle Junshan, and so many people
in the Hui Ink industry.

06:41.240 --> 06:43.500
There's no way
we can fully make up for it.

06:43.510 --> 06:44.600
How I wish

06:46.480 --> 06:47.430
I could do more

06:49.000 --> 06:50.040
to make amends.

06:55.430 --> 06:56.560
Third Grandfather.

07:05.600 --> 07:07.160
You two girls

07:07.270 --> 07:08.670
have one thing in common.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.480
At such a young age,

07:12.360 --> 07:13.820
you are both strong enough

07:13.830 --> 07:15.630
to shoulder responsibilities.

07:16.830 --> 07:17.800
Stand up now.

07:27.630 --> 07:28.870
Miss Tian,

07:31.140 --> 07:33.540
you had been away
from Huizhou for too long.

07:34.159 --> 07:37.510
Try the She County's Lotus Tea I brewed.

07:39.120 --> 07:42.159
This is the taste from your hometown.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.320
What are you waiting for?

07:48.720 --> 07:49.720
Go ahead.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.980
Third Grandfather has forgiven you.

07:52.180 --> 07:52.850
Go ahead!

07:52.870 --> 07:54.600
Thank you, Third Grandfather.

08:01.680 --> 08:02.430
Give it a try.

08:08.600 --> 08:09.390
How is it?

08:16.310 --> 08:17.190
Zhen,

08:18.630 --> 08:20.310
it's been such a long day.

08:21.360 --> 08:22.360
I feel

08:22.480 --> 08:24.280
it's longer than any day before.

08:25.430 --> 08:27.090
So many things have happened,

08:27.190 --> 08:29.310
and the sun is finally going to set.

08:30.270 --> 08:31.040
Yes.

08:31.480 --> 08:33.120
When the sun rises tomorrow,

08:33.600 --> 08:35.840
everything that happened today
will be in the past

08:35.840 --> 08:37.080
and be gone forever.

08:39.150 --> 08:39.960
Ronghua,

08:40.510 --> 08:41.720
come home with me.

08:42.630 --> 08:44.960
If you think City Gate Lane is
too crowded,

08:44.960 --> 08:47.270
you can live in my New Li Ink Workshop.

08:48.630 --> 08:49.510
Zhen.

08:49.720 --> 08:52.180
Do you still remember
the employment letter

08:52.480 --> 08:54.030
I gave you in Nanjing?

08:55.320 --> 08:57.520
I've wanted to hire you as an accountant

08:57.550 --> 08:59.030
at my New Li Ink Workshop.

08:59.320 --> 09:00.720
You wouldn't live for free.

09:00.720 --> 09:02.750
You have to work for me, understand?

09:04.600 --> 09:05.360
What?

09:05.720 --> 09:06.670
Are you refusing it

09:06.670 --> 09:08.550
because you have quit
your old profession for a long time

09:08.550 --> 09:09.550
and gotten rusty?

09:10.320 --> 09:11.150
Zhen.

09:13.670 --> 09:15.270
I want to show you something.

09:20.320 --> 09:20.780
Well...

09:21.080 --> 09:21.910
You still keep

09:22.320 --> 09:23.360
this abacus bead?

09:24.390 --> 09:25.440
Yes, of course.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.150
Ronghua,

09:27.550 --> 09:28.360
I know

09:28.670 --> 09:31.070
when you gave me
this abacus bead back then,

09:31.080 --> 09:32.430
you were entrusting me with the life

09:32.430 --> 09:34.030
that you couldn't get to live.

09:34.030 --> 09:34.910
Today,

09:35.390 --> 09:37.050
I'm returning it to its owner.

09:37.840 --> 09:38.550
Ronghua,

09:38.960 --> 09:40.240
the past is

09:40.960 --> 09:41.960
in the past.

09:42.550 --> 09:43.960
From now on,

09:44.790 --> 09:46.000
we'll start anew.

09:50.750 --> 09:51.480
Zhen,

09:52.840 --> 09:53.600
thank you.

09:56.390 --> 09:57.720
Accepting this abacus bead

09:57.720 --> 09:59.120
means you have agreed

09:59.120 --> 10:01.650
to be the accountant
at my New Li Ink Workshop.

10:04.630 --> 10:06.320
Let's go, dear accountant.

10:14.070 --> 10:15.190
Sister Cuiqiao!

10:16.270 --> 10:17.360
Cuiqiao!

10:20.320 --> 10:21.120
Zhen.

10:21.510 --> 10:23.630
Is there any reply
from the Princess's Mansion?

10:23.630 --> 10:25.480
My men rode fast to deliver your letter

10:25.480 --> 10:27.200
and waited there for a day and a night.

10:27.200 --> 10:28.320
Here is the reply.

10:30.910 --> 10:32.000
Did anything happen

10:32.000 --> 10:33.390
at the Nanjing Garrison Commander's Manor?

10:33.390 --> 10:34.150
Don't worry.

10:34.150 --> 10:36.010
Wu Ru hasn't taken any action yet.

10:43.240 --> 10:44.370
The letter says that

10:44.910 --> 10:46.390
the news about the Tian family's

10:46.390 --> 10:48.390
illicit foreign trade
has spread in Nanjing.

10:48.390 --> 10:50.360
The Princess has personally intervened

10:50.360 --> 10:51.760
and warned Commander Wu.

10:52.150 --> 10:53.910
Commander Wu is in hot water himself

10:53.910 --> 10:56.310
and cannot shield the Tian family anymore.

10:58.000 --> 10:59.360
The letter also says that

10:59.360 --> 11:00.960
the Directorate of Ceremony has blocked

11:00.960 --> 11:02.630
the impeachment memorial
against Marshal Qi.

11:02.630 --> 11:03.550
Really?

11:04.000 --> 11:04.720
Check it out.

11:04.720 --> 11:05.480
For real?

11:10.380 --> 11:11.610
This is wonderful.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.720
Wenqian

11:14.670 --> 11:16.910
finally got a silver lining.

11:17.720 --> 11:18.720
Marshal Qi

11:19.030 --> 11:20.890
can also breathe a sigh of relief.

11:22.630 --> 11:24.440
Now, Commander Wu is tied up
covering up for himself,

11:24.440 --> 11:25.840
trying to save his own skin.

11:25.840 --> 11:26.550
So this is

11:26.720 --> 11:27.870
the perfect time for us

11:27.870 --> 11:29.360
to completely bring down Tian Benchang.

11:29.360 --> 11:30.890
Do you have any plans, then?

11:31.790 --> 11:33.390
Although the Tian Mansion
and Tian Ink Workshop

11:33.390 --> 11:34.480
have been seized,

11:34.970 --> 11:35.830
since they were

11:36.150 --> 11:37.880
put into prison all of a sudden,

11:38.030 --> 11:39.840
I think there might still be some clues

11:39.840 --> 11:41.320
that they didn't have time to clean up,

11:41.320 --> 11:42.440
and that would be

11:42.440 --> 11:43.550
a chance for us.

11:44.030 --> 11:46.360
So, we must try to thoroughly

11:46.440 --> 11:48.240
look into the Tian family again.

12:02.270 --> 12:03.270
Officer Zhang!

12:03.600 --> 12:04.600
Mr. Zhang!

12:04.740 --> 12:05.860
Mr. Zhang!

12:06.130 --> 12:08.220
Shut up! What are you yelling about?

12:09.120 --> 12:09.840
Officer,

12:10.630 --> 12:11.790
it's been days.

12:12.080 --> 12:12.870
Why hasn't my second brother been

12:12.870 --> 12:14.150
sentenced for the illicit foreign trade?

12:14.150 --> 12:15.880
Is there any news from outside?

12:18.150 --> 12:20.030
Mr. Zhang, you're finally here!

12:20.870 --> 12:21.670
Mr. Zhang.

12:23.320 --> 12:24.120
Open the door.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.120
Mr. Zhang.

12:42.390 --> 12:43.200
Mr. Zhang,

12:43.510 --> 12:45.370
is there any letter from Nanjing?

12:49.670 --> 12:51.130
Eldest Young Master Tian,

12:51.510 --> 12:52.960
let me be honest with you.

12:54.000 --> 12:55.930
Since your Tians were imprisoned,

12:56.240 --> 13:00.770
there hasn't been a single message from
the Nanjing Garrison Commander's Manor.

13:01.390 --> 13:03.360
Didn't you always claim

13:03.480 --> 13:05.880
that Commander Wu was
on good terms with you

13:05.960 --> 13:08.560
and would definitely
protect the Tian family?

13:08.750 --> 13:10.750
Did you make all that up in your head?

13:15.480 --> 13:17.000
Mr. Zhang, could you please

13:17.000 --> 13:19.060
get me a writing brush and some paper?

13:25.120 --> 13:26.030
Don't forget,

13:26.870 --> 13:29.530
you received
quite a lot of money from me before.

13:31.000 --> 13:32.260
If you push me too hard,

13:32.510 --> 13:34.360
I'll spill everything in court.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.080
Mr. Zhang,

13:39.360 --> 13:40.440
please send this letter

13:40.440 --> 13:41.910
to the Nanjing Garrison Commander's Manor

13:41.910 --> 13:43.960
and make sure you give it
to Commander Wu personally.

13:43.960 --> 13:44.960
He will surely help us out

13:44.960 --> 13:46.360
once he sees this letter.

13:46.750 --> 13:48.390
Prefect He is dead set on getting

13:48.390 --> 13:51.650
to the bottom of your Tian family's
illicit foreign trade.

13:52.270 --> 13:54.200
The past few days, he's been
dispatching people to investigate

13:54.200 --> 13:56.460
the refugees making ink for your family.

13:56.640 --> 13:58.520
If someone gives you away,

14:01.200 --> 14:02.840
you'll be as good as dead.

14:04.480 --> 14:07.010
Do not drag me down with you
when that happens.

14:10.670 --> 14:11.440
Mr. Zhang,

14:11.870 --> 14:13.390
so long as you help me
deliver this letter,

14:13.390 --> 14:14.520
you'll be my savior.

14:15.030 --> 14:16.280
I still have some money

14:16.280 --> 14:17.590
deposited in Nanjing.

14:18.270 --> 14:20.390
Take this receipt and withdraw it.

14:20.790 --> 14:22.320
Consider it my gift for you.

14:23.050 --> 14:24.150
When I get out of here one day,

14:24.150 --> 14:26.080
I will never forget your kindness.

14:38.720 --> 14:39.790
Is it clean money?

14:40.670 --> 14:42.240
Clean, absolutely clean.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.920
Ronghua, let's go...

15:13.870 --> 15:14.670
Ronghua,

15:15.080 --> 15:16.960
I can do the search on my own.

15:17.150 --> 15:17.720
How about this?

15:17.720 --> 15:21.050
You go back to New Li Ink Workshop
and wait for me there, okay?

15:22.030 --> 15:23.320
I'll search with you.

15:24.390 --> 15:26.390
I know where everything is

15:26.600 --> 15:28.270
kept here better than you do.

15:28.910 --> 15:30.360
You told me before

15:31.000 --> 15:33.440
that facing the past
and exposing old scars

15:34.200 --> 15:36.200
is the first step to a new beginning.

15:42.840 --> 15:45.240
I also want to see the truest side
of my home,

15:48.200 --> 15:49.630
so I can say goodbye

15:51.080 --> 15:52.150
to it properly.

15:55.790 --> 15:58.520
Ronghua, you're the bravest person
in the world.

15:59.510 --> 16:00.970
Then let's do it together.

16:02.030 --> 16:02.560
Let's go.

16:06.960 --> 16:07.960
You're drinking?

16:08.840 --> 16:09.840
Hi, Mr. Zhang.

16:10.480 --> 16:11.600
W-Who is this?

16:11.720 --> 16:12.510
A newcomer.

16:47.640 --> 16:49.120
Take your time, sir.

16:49.510 --> 16:50.080
Okay.

16:55.480 --> 16:56.270
Who are you?

17:03.700 --> 17:05.089
[Nanjing Garrison Commander's Manor]

17:07.400 --> 17:09.400
You're from
the Nanjing Garrison Commander's Manor?

17:09.400 --> 17:10.859
What did Commander Wu say?

17:13.920 --> 17:16.160
Where is that thing you mentioned?

17:16.750 --> 17:17.790
If I tell you now,

17:19.069 --> 17:20.200
can I get out of here?

17:24.750 --> 17:25.810
Help me out of here.

17:26.240 --> 17:28.770
If you don't tell me,
I'll kill you right away.

17:34.510 --> 17:35.570
Help me out of here,

17:37.110 --> 17:38.680
and I will definitely hand over

17:38.680 --> 17:40.290
the account book exactly as it is to you.

17:40.290 --> 17:42.690
Otherwise, no one will get away with it!

17:52.790 --> 17:53.790
Officer Zhang.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.550
Officer Zhang!

18:02.680 --> 18:03.270
Sir.

18:07.590 --> 18:08.520
What's going on?

18:15.590 --> 18:16.510
Zhen.

18:17.400 --> 18:18.240
Zhen?

18:22.000 --> 18:22.750
Zhen,

18:22.960 --> 18:25.200
we've searched everywhere.

18:25.400 --> 18:27.030
If there was really something important,

18:27.030 --> 18:27.880
wouldn't Benchang

18:27.880 --> 18:29.640
have hidden it somewhere else?

18:30.200 --> 18:31.350
It is possible.

18:32.150 --> 18:34.200
But I've always had a doubt.

18:34.680 --> 18:36.110
At the critical moment

18:36.200 --> 18:37.830
the other day, Tian Benchang

18:38.200 --> 18:40.640
actually took out
the documents of illicit foreign trade

18:40.640 --> 18:42.000
and shifted all the blame

18:42.000 --> 18:43.550
onto your second brother.

18:44.030 --> 18:45.200
So I guess

18:45.200 --> 18:46.270
he was always wary

18:46.270 --> 18:47.070
and on guard.

18:47.310 --> 18:48.640
Therefore, he must have

18:48.680 --> 18:49.640
put those documents

18:49.640 --> 18:51.240
somewhere he could easily access.

18:51.240 --> 18:52.410
That means we can't miss

18:52.410 --> 18:54.480
a single corner
in the entire Tian Residence.

18:54.480 --> 18:55.740
Let's keep searching.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.480
If what you say is true,

18:58.790 --> 18:59.880
then these things

18:59.920 --> 19:01.160
must have been stored

19:01.270 --> 19:03.730
where others wouldn't easily look through.

19:11.270 --> 19:11.960
Ronghua.

19:15.880 --> 19:16.720
What's that?

19:18.110 --> 19:19.960
This is the scroll of a ritual poem
that Benchang humbly

19:19.960 --> 19:21.400
asked Sage Qing He to write in person.

19:21.400 --> 19:23.000
Ever since our family
got this scroll of the ritual poem,

19:23.000 --> 19:24.400
he had cherished it like a treasure.

19:24.400 --> 19:25.790
Not only did he mount
and frame it himself,

19:25.790 --> 19:28.120
but he also specially hung it
in the study.

19:28.880 --> 19:31.270
Although Sage Qing He got into trouble,

19:31.550 --> 19:33.810
he hasn't completely fallen
from power.

19:35.160 --> 19:37.490
The officers were probably afraid of him,

19:37.790 --> 19:40.000
so they didn't dare to touch his thing.

19:43.510 --> 19:45.720
The antiques and paintings in our house

19:46.240 --> 19:48.440
have all been searched by the officers.

19:48.440 --> 19:50.440
But only this scroll of the ritual poem

19:50.440 --> 19:51.680
seems untouched.

20:07.070 --> 20:07.830
Wait.

20:11.200 --> 20:12.440
There's something inside.

20:12.440 --> 20:12.880
Take it down.

20:12.880 --> 20:13.350
Okay.

20:18.110 --> 20:18.880
See?

20:22.710 --> 20:24.040
Ronghua, don't tear it.

20:24.790 --> 20:25.680
What's there to be afraid of?

20:25.680 --> 20:27.640
This place is still
beyond Sage Qing He's reach right now.

20:27.640 --> 20:29.790
How much pain did he bring to your family

20:29.790 --> 20:30.880
and Third Master Chen back then?

20:30.880 --> 20:32.920
Since I introduced this person here,

20:32.920 --> 20:33.920
I should be the one

20:34.110 --> 20:36.310
to end this evil trend with my own hands.

20:43.350 --> 20:44.750
Take it slow. Be careful.

20:54.960 --> 20:55.890
A travel permit?

20:57.490 --> 21:00.880
[Travel Permit: An official travel document
issued by the Ming government]

20:58.270 --> 20:59.510
Lu Wei,

21:00.880 --> 21:04.270
[for people to prove their identity
during long journeys.]

21:01.680 --> 21:04.440
a merchant from Fujian.

21:06.030 --> 21:07.110
So,

21:07.640 --> 21:08.840
why did Tian Benchang

21:09.240 --> 21:10.920
go to such great lengths

21:11.160 --> 21:12.490
to hide a travel permit?

21:17.510 --> 21:19.400
Manager Zhen, Miss Tian,

21:19.790 --> 21:21.200
are you still inside?

21:21.510 --> 21:23.160
Bad news! Tian Benchang...

21:23.440 --> 21:24.900
He's escaped from prison!

21:28.290 --> 21:29.370
Let me in!

21:29.400 --> 21:30.720
I want to see Lord He.

21:31.030 --> 21:32.150
Let her in.

21:33.790 --> 21:35.160
Your Excellency, Tian Benchang...

21:35.160 --> 21:36.590
Li Zhen, hold on.

21:43.510 --> 21:44.310
You go on.

21:46.480 --> 21:47.160
Your Excellency,

21:47.160 --> 21:49.720
Officer Zhang
brought a stranger over tonight.

21:49.720 --> 21:51.920
I was just about to go take a closer look,

21:52.030 --> 21:53.960
a-and that man just knocked me out.

21:54.920 --> 21:55.830
Zhang Guang,

21:56.200 --> 21:59.240
I can't believe you dared to help someone
escape from prison!

21:59.240 --> 22:00.350
M-My Lord,

22:00.790 --> 22:02.240
I know nothing.

22:02.480 --> 22:04.010
That person knocked me out.

22:04.440 --> 22:05.720
And I just

22:06.000 --> 22:08.000
woke up to this state.

22:08.240 --> 22:10.830
What is that person's name and background?

22:11.070 --> 22:13.110
I-I don't know his name.

22:13.790 --> 22:15.880
H-He seems to be...

22:16.230 --> 22:17.440
I think he... I think...

22:17.440 --> 22:18.240
Out with it!

22:19.640 --> 22:20.350
Yes...

22:21.160 --> 22:23.440
I think he's from
the Nanjing Garrison Commander's Manor.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.310
I once asked someone to help

22:24.310 --> 22:25.640
Tian Benchang send a letter to the Nanjing

22:25.640 --> 22:27.000
Garrison Commander's Manor.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.660
Soon after, that person came,

22:28.790 --> 22:30.920
saying he wanted to see Tian Benchang.

22:32.880 --> 22:33.880
Your Excellency,

22:34.270 --> 22:35.240
Commander Wu

22:35.240 --> 22:36.950
had been ignoring the Tian family.

22:36.950 --> 22:38.950
But his man took such a risk tonight

22:38.980 --> 22:40.270
to get Tian Benchang out of jail.

22:40.270 --> 22:42.070
There must be a reason behind it.

22:42.110 --> 22:43.000
I guess

22:43.680 --> 22:44.880
Tian Benchang must have

22:44.880 --> 22:46.510
gotten something on Commander Wu,

22:46.510 --> 22:48.910
blackmailing Commander Wu to help him out.

22:50.480 --> 22:51.240
Tell me

22:51.350 --> 22:53.440
what that letter said.

22:53.920 --> 22:56.310
It said... It said...

22:58.070 --> 22:58.720
Right,

22:59.590 --> 23:00.520
an account book.

23:01.160 --> 23:03.720
Yes, it said there was an account book

23:03.880 --> 23:05.070
that Commander Wu wanted.

23:05.070 --> 23:06.310
But Tian Benchang said

23:06.310 --> 23:08.570
he would only offer it after he broke out.

23:09.000 --> 23:11.600
Bring the prisoner,
Tian Bensheng, over here.

23:18.310 --> 23:19.170
Tian Bensheng,

23:20.310 --> 23:22.160
where is Tian Benchang?

23:22.640 --> 23:23.900
If he really gets away,

23:23.960 --> 23:26.720
you'll be the one taking the death penalty
for illicit foreign trade.

23:26.720 --> 23:27.920
Try your best to recall

23:27.920 --> 23:29.510
where that account book is!

23:29.720 --> 23:31.520
I have no idea, Your Excellency.

23:32.000 --> 23:33.270
I've confessed everything

23:33.270 --> 23:35.030
I know about our family.

23:36.030 --> 23:37.270
I've never even heard

23:37.640 --> 23:39.570
of the account book you mentioned.

23:39.590 --> 23:42.110
Tian Benchang didn't tell me everything.

23:42.790 --> 23:43.720
My father

23:44.200 --> 23:46.030
only saw me as a fool.

23:47.620 --> 23:49.150
I don't know anything else.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.610
I really don't know anything else.

23:53.160 --> 23:54.160
Your Excellency,

23:54.240 --> 23:56.350
I would like to see Tian Huai'an.

23:56.510 --> 23:58.070
Perhaps right now, besides Tian Benchang,

23:58.070 --> 23:59.400
only Tian Huai'an knows

23:59.590 --> 24:01.350
where this account book is.

24:03.750 --> 24:04.550
Well...

24:08.630 --> 24:11.250
[Travel Permit]

24:11.680 --> 24:14.070
Your Excellency,
it's hard to travel at night.

24:14.070 --> 24:16.030
Tian Benchang couldn't have gone far.

24:16.030 --> 24:17.000
It'll be too late

24:17.030 --> 24:18.310
if we delay any longer.

24:18.640 --> 24:19.570
I'm begging you.

24:19.960 --> 24:21.420
Please let me give it a try.

24:22.310 --> 24:22.880
Alright.

24:24.070 --> 24:25.670
Thank you, Your Excellency.

24:44.070 --> 24:45.330
How much further is it?

24:47.970 --> 24:49.630
It's right in the woods ahead.

24:58.960 --> 24:59.550
Sir,

25:00.880 --> 25:02.500
I haven't been here in a while.

25:02.500 --> 25:04.300
I think I have forgotten the way.

25:06.790 --> 25:08.240
Maybe we should go that way.

25:08.240 --> 25:09.850
Where exactly is that place?

25:11.590 --> 25:12.350
Sir,

25:13.240 --> 25:15.000
if you put this sword away,

25:15.640 --> 25:17.680
maybe I'll start remembering it.

25:24.880 --> 25:26.280
This place is so desolate

25:26.440 --> 25:29.100
that no carriages can pass,
and no one is around.

25:29.110 --> 25:31.160
I couldn't escape even if I had wings.

25:31.160 --> 25:32.510
Since you promised me

25:32.590 --> 25:33.510
that you'd let me go

25:33.510 --> 25:35.170
once you get the account book,

25:35.510 --> 25:37.710
I have no reason to play tricks with you.

25:37.780 --> 25:38.300
Sir!

25:49.070 --> 25:49.880
Sir,

25:50.720 --> 25:51.880
could you lend me

25:52.270 --> 25:53.550
your token?

25:54.590 --> 25:56.250
What do you need the token for?

25:58.350 --> 25:59.960
I am penniless now,

26:00.640 --> 26:03.240
and I can't go back home
to get my travel permit.

26:03.830 --> 26:05.030
With this token,

26:05.510 --> 26:07.770
I can at least enter a city somewhere else

26:08.240 --> 26:09.170
and settle down.

26:10.480 --> 26:13.740
You can worry about the future
after you hand over the item.

26:22.920 --> 26:23.590
Thank you.

26:27.350 --> 26:28.310
Master Tian.

26:29.350 --> 26:30.160
Madam Tian.

26:33.070 --> 26:34.070
Why are you here?

26:40.550 --> 26:41.350
Master Tian,

26:41.960 --> 26:43.350
that day in court,

26:43.590 --> 26:45.790
you didn't mention anything
about Tian Benchang

26:45.790 --> 26:47.920
and put all the blame on Tian Bensheng.

26:48.350 --> 26:49.880
You must have believed that

26:50.270 --> 26:52.130
sacrificing Tian Bensheng alone

26:52.400 --> 26:54.460
would leave the Tian family a way out.

26:56.490 --> 26:57.440
Indeed,

26:58.000 --> 27:00.600
as stupid
and incompetent as Tian Bensheng is,

27:00.680 --> 27:02.010
abandoning him is fine.

27:02.730 --> 27:04.860
As long as you can save your eldest son,

27:05.510 --> 27:06.370
the Tian family

27:06.590 --> 27:07.850
still stands a chance,

27:08.030 --> 27:08.680
right?

27:11.030 --> 27:12.160
I don't get

27:12.790 --> 27:14.450
a single thing you are saying.

27:17.680 --> 27:19.000
I came here today

27:19.460 --> 27:21.160
just to inform you both that Tian Benchang

27:21.160 --> 27:22.560
has escaped from prison.

27:23.920 --> 27:24.790
What?

27:25.830 --> 27:27.290
He's escaped from prison?

27:28.310 --> 27:29.440
Just last night,

27:30.030 --> 27:31.590
someone sneaked into the prison

27:31.590 --> 27:32.850
and got him out of here.

27:32.880 --> 27:34.110
Don't listen to her nonsense.

27:34.110 --> 27:35.200
He didn't escape.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.920
He must have been released.

27:36.920 --> 27:38.720
D-Don't listen to her nonsense.

27:44.830 --> 27:46.750
I didn't want to give this to you,

27:47.750 --> 27:49.110
but at this point...

27:52.960 --> 27:53.720
Master Tian,

27:55.920 --> 27:56.920
check this out.

27:59.070 --> 28:00.870
Do you recognize the words on it?

28:02.830 --> 28:04.350
This was found inside the scroll

28:04.350 --> 28:06.810
of the ritual poem
in Tian Benchang's study.

28:09.200 --> 28:10.730
It seems that Tian Benchang

28:11.270 --> 28:13.000
left himself a way out long ago.

28:14.160 --> 28:15.550
With this travel permit,

28:15.550 --> 28:17.270
he can change his name

28:17.270 --> 28:18.350
and start anew.

28:20.350 --> 28:21.270
But what a pity.

28:22.590 --> 28:24.390
There is only one travel permit,

28:25.720 --> 28:26.590
with no others.

28:32.550 --> 28:35.310
What is this travel permit about, Darling?

28:36.000 --> 28:38.960
What exactly does Zhen mean by this?

28:39.270 --> 28:40.440
Madam Tian,

28:40.590 --> 28:42.190
do you still not understand?

28:42.270 --> 28:43.960
Tian Benchang could even abandon

28:43.960 --> 28:45.620
and make use of his own sister.

28:45.640 --> 28:47.440
What else can't he let go of?

28:50.400 --> 28:51.160
Darling,

28:51.550 --> 28:53.480
Benchang won't leave us behind,

28:53.590 --> 28:54.270
right?

28:54.480 --> 28:55.400
Don't talk nonsense!

28:55.400 --> 28:56.860
I'm not talking nonsense.

28:57.270 --> 28:58.750
Our family ending up like this

28:58.750 --> 28:59.790
is all your fault!

28:59.790 --> 29:00.960
You indulged them!

29:00.960 --> 29:02.000
So they've turned out like this!

29:02.000 --> 29:02.860
Madam Tian.

29:02.880 --> 29:03.640
Madam Tian.

29:03.640 --> 29:04.960
Madam Tian, please calm down.

29:04.960 --> 29:05.640
Madam Tian.

29:09.720 --> 29:10.550
Madam Tian,

29:11.750 --> 29:13.400
I understand how you feel.

29:13.960 --> 29:15.200
A mother's love

29:15.440 --> 29:18.160
for her children knows no bounds.

29:19.030 --> 29:21.350
A mother cherishes her every child

29:21.640 --> 29:22.880
deeply in her heart.

29:23.350 --> 29:25.640
She cannot bear to lose any of them.

29:26.680 --> 29:28.000
That day in court,

29:29.070 --> 29:30.870
you must have been heartbroken.

29:37.000 --> 29:39.750
Now that Tian Benchang has
escaped from prison to avoid punishment,

29:39.750 --> 29:41.550
his crimes have only escalated.

29:42.070 --> 29:45.030
And Tian Bensheng is basically dead meat.

29:46.240 --> 29:47.350
The two of you will

29:48.480 --> 29:49.590
also be severely punished.

29:49.590 --> 29:51.030
Even Ronghua

29:51.270 --> 29:52.730
can't escape punishment.

29:54.590 --> 29:55.720
The disaster caused by one person

29:55.720 --> 29:57.520
will drag the whole family down.

29:57.720 --> 29:58.440
I think

29:59.200 --> 30:00.930
this must be the worst outcome.

30:02.310 --> 30:03.830
Bensheng, Ronghua...

30:03.830 --> 30:04.590
Darling,

30:05.480 --> 30:07.550
we must save Ronghua and Bensheng,

30:08.160 --> 30:09.960
these two poor kids.

30:14.110 --> 30:14.830
Zhen,

30:16.790 --> 30:18.400
what exactly do you want?

30:20.920 --> 30:21.880
Master Tian,

30:23.070 --> 30:23.880
I know

30:26.110 --> 30:28.840
Tian Benchang has an account book.
Is that right?

30:39.720 --> 30:41.110
Master Tian, listen to me.

30:41.110 --> 30:42.270
This account book

30:42.720 --> 30:44.160
might be your Tian family's only

30:44.160 --> 30:45.750
and last chance.

30:45.920 --> 30:47.920
Tian Benchang managed to escape

30:47.920 --> 30:49.070
because he used this account book

30:49.070 --> 30:51.110
to trade for his life with Commander Wu.

30:51.110 --> 30:52.200
But in reality,

30:52.440 --> 30:54.720
once Commander Wu gets this account book,

30:54.720 --> 30:55.960
he will definitely get away unscathed.

30:55.960 --> 30:58.880
After that, he will surely
turn against your family.

30:58.880 --> 30:59.790
In that case,

31:00.440 --> 31:01.790
your whole Tian family

31:02.240 --> 31:03.400
will be doomed,

31:04.070 --> 31:05.550
with no one surviving.

31:08.830 --> 31:09.920
Master Tian,

31:11.110 --> 31:12.480
the only way out now

31:12.480 --> 31:14.310
is to find Tian Benchang,

31:14.790 --> 31:16.310
bring him to justice,

31:16.310 --> 31:18.040
and let him confess his crimes.

31:18.480 --> 31:19.740
Only then can this case

31:20.350 --> 31:22.310
be completely solved.

31:24.510 --> 31:25.240
Darling,

31:25.960 --> 31:27.310
Zhen is right.

31:27.350 --> 31:28.400
If you know where Benchang

31:28.400 --> 31:29.680
has escaped to,

31:29.790 --> 31:31.830
o-or if you know about the account book
she just mentioned,

31:31.830 --> 31:33.240
just tell her right away.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.740
Be honest with her now.

31:38.030 --> 31:39.630
How could it end up like this?

31:41.110 --> 31:42.160
Benchang said

31:43.440 --> 31:44.960
he wouldn't abandon us.

31:45.480 --> 31:46.750
He wouldn't abandon us?

31:46.750 --> 31:47.720
He already fled!

31:47.720 --> 31:49.380
You call it not abandoning us?

31:49.960 --> 31:51.000
Darling!

31:52.070 --> 31:53.830
Don't make any more mistakes.

31:54.830 --> 31:55.750
Now,

31:56.440 --> 31:58.500
you can't protect Benchang anymore.

31:58.750 --> 32:02.270
Now, we can only try our best
to keep Bensheng

32:02.270 --> 32:03.720
and Ronghua safe.

32:04.070 --> 32:06.750
Our family can't fall apart, Darling.

32:09.880 --> 32:10.680
Zhen,

32:11.720 --> 32:12.680
I'm begging you.

32:12.750 --> 32:14.240
Please save Ronghua.

32:14.270 --> 32:16.110
You two are such good friends.

32:28.000 --> 32:29.000
Madam Tian,

32:29.550 --> 32:31.550
whether the Tian family can be saved

32:31.790 --> 32:33.070
is not up to me now.

32:35.030 --> 32:36.290
It's up to Master Tian.

33:13.070 --> 33:13.720
Hurry up.

33:34.200 --> 33:35.550
Where is it?

33:37.240 --> 33:38.200
Inside the room.

33:40.030 --> 33:40.680
Go.

33:55.960 --> 33:57.030
Are you fooling me?

33:57.400 --> 33:58.400
Do you want to die?

33:58.510 --> 33:59.880
Where on earth is it?

34:00.720 --> 34:01.440
Sir,

34:01.750 --> 34:02.790
it's behind the curtain.

34:02.790 --> 34:03.920
Behind the curtain.

34:08.480 --> 34:11.110
It'd better be over there.

34:11.880 --> 34:12.590
It is.

34:13.190 --> 34:13.760
It is.

34:16.590 --> 34:17.360
Come here.

34:29.320 --> 34:30.320
Behave yourself.

34:30.760 --> 34:31.360
Okay?

35:32.950 --> 35:35.470
[Tian Family's Account Book]

36:20.510 --> 36:21.030
Hurry.

36:21.320 --> 36:21.760
Go.

36:21.960 --> 36:22.320
Go.

36:50.110 --> 36:50.960
Where is he?

37:05.800 --> 37:06.670
Let me go!

37:32.590 --> 37:33.280
Father,

37:34.510 --> 37:35.280
Wensong,

37:37.510 --> 37:39.030
thanks to Miss Li Zhen,

37:40.550 --> 37:43.670
the Tian family has finally been
thrown into prison.

37:45.670 --> 37:48.520
The lost souls of our Luo family

37:51.320 --> 37:52.980
can finally rest in peace now.

38:03.800 --> 38:06.660
You can finally get over the nightmares
that you've

38:08.110 --> 38:09.840
suffered from all these years.

38:15.800 --> 38:16.510
Zhen.

38:22.590 --> 38:24.920
This is a toast to you.

38:26.190 --> 38:28.120
From our childhood acquaintance,

38:28.630 --> 38:30.630
to knowing each other better later,

38:32.360 --> 38:34.960
and through all the situations
that followed,

38:35.480 --> 38:37.410
it was all thanks to you that things

38:37.710 --> 38:39.510
could take a turn for the better.

38:41.000 --> 38:42.590
I'm lucky to have met you.

38:44.480 --> 38:45.360
Thank you.

38:46.440 --> 38:47.280
A toast to you.

39:10.150 --> 39:11.110
Master Qi.

39:12.440 --> 39:13.440
Luo Wenqian.

39:14.880 --> 39:16.190
This one is for you.

39:17.590 --> 39:19.650
Thank you for always sticking with me

39:20.110 --> 39:22.070
through thick and thin.

39:25.960 --> 39:27.110
No drinking.

39:27.880 --> 39:30.400
Drinking too much
will give you a headache.

39:32.840 --> 39:35.170
At least I don't act wildly
when I'm drunk.

39:35.670 --> 39:36.550
Somebody

39:36.550 --> 39:38.190
caused a scene
at our house after drinking,

39:38.190 --> 39:39.920
made Benchang take care of him,

39:40.360 --> 39:42.020
and kept crying and demanding

39:42.360 --> 39:43.760
to go to the second floor.

39:45.480 --> 39:47.960
I really didn't know
the second floor was your bedroom.

39:47.960 --> 39:49.320
If only I had known...

39:51.920 --> 39:52.670
Let's eat.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.170
Let's eat up.

39:54.760 --> 39:55.800
How silly.

39:55.840 --> 39:56.840
Eat up.

39:57.190 --> 39:57.670
Come on.

39:58.920 --> 40:00.000
I made all of the dishes.

40:00.000 --> 40:00.730
Give it a try.

40:05.110 --> 40:07.710
Oh, right, before we eat...

40:09.670 --> 40:10.630
Sit down first.

40:11.480 --> 40:13.800
I want to discuss something with you.

40:20.320 --> 40:21.850
Besides the military funds

40:23.120 --> 40:24.720
which need to be handed in,

40:26.030 --> 40:27.960
I still have 2,000 taels of silver.

40:29.320 --> 40:32.110
I asked Cuiqiao to convert them
into two vouchers.

40:32.110 --> 40:33.000
You can turn to her

40:33.000 --> 40:34.730
whenever you're in need, okay?

40:37.030 --> 40:39.290
You want to push me away again, don't you?

40:39.670 --> 40:40.510
No, no.

40:40.670 --> 40:42.000
That's not what I meant.

40:45.070 --> 40:47.330
Even though the Tian family is in prison,

40:48.360 --> 40:49.840
my sentence

40:50.710 --> 40:52.190
will likely be

40:52.190 --> 40:54.710
exile for at least 10 to 20 years.

40:55.760 --> 40:57.030
I mean, if

40:57.630 --> 40:59.400
I'm not around

41:00.110 --> 41:01.360
and you ever

41:01.710 --> 41:03.320
need money, just in case,

41:04.550 --> 41:06.410
you can use this for emergencies.

41:28.030 --> 41:29.670
And this rouge ink,

41:30.840 --> 41:32.030
could you

41:32.050 --> 41:33.860
keep it for me for the time being?

41:35.550 --> 41:37.320
During my exile,

41:37.550 --> 41:39.280
I don't want to affect

41:39.510 --> 41:42.920
your happy life
for the next 10 or 20 years.

41:43.190 --> 41:45.920
You can completely start over...

41:46.920 --> 41:47.920
Of course, if one day

41:47.920 --> 41:49.510
I can come back,

41:49.630 --> 41:50.710
I will find you...

41:53.150 --> 41:55.280
You can't take back what you've given.

41:57.550 --> 41:59.440
Look at me. Look me in the eyes.

42:01.400 --> 42:02.840
Luo Wenqian, listen up.

42:03.280 --> 42:04.480
For the person I love,

42:05.280 --> 42:06.320
not even the end of the world

42:06.320 --> 42:07.550
could make me give in.

42:09.280 --> 42:11.210
Whatever the verdict is tomorrow,

42:12.230 --> 42:13.840
I will face it with you.

42:14.590 --> 42:15.710
Understood?

42:44.440 --> 42:45.000
Don't be sad.

42:45.000 --> 42:46.150
It was my fault just now.

42:46.150 --> 42:47.680
